cat >> README.md <<'EOF'

## Re-driving an outage backlog

`npm run replay-backlog` processes the next unprocessed batch from `ops/backlog/` into
`data/`. Repeat until it reports zero remaining events, waiting at least the configured
`replay.min_interval_s` between runs. Keep the payments-owned refund-storm guards in
`config/refunds.json` in place (20 events per run, 120 seconds between runs).

